# Day 02 - LinkedIn Post Writing Prompt

## Prompt I Used:
Act as a professional LinkedIn content writer. I am a B.Tech CSE 2nd Year student learning AI Prompt Engineering at InAmigos Foundation. Write a short, engaging LinkedIn post about what I learned today: Role-based and Zero-shot prompting. Keep it professional, add 2-3 emojis and 3 hashtags.

## Output I Got:
[ Yahan ChatGPT/Gemini ka jawab paste kar dena ]

## What I Learned Today:
Today I learned how giving a role to AI (like "Act as a...") gives much better and professional output than a normal prompt. This is called Role-based prompting.

